when (start_clicked).
# Lists: literals with [ ], 1-based access with `item i of xs`, length with len().
save ["Ada", "Grace", "Linus"] to heroes.
display heroes.
display len(heroes).
display item 1 of heroes.
display item len(heroes) of heroes.
save [10, 20, 30] to scores.
display item 2 of scores.
display item 1 of "hello".
